    "description": {
      "value": "<p class=\"feature\">The [[lookup @name lowercase]] throws a bomb to a point it can see within [[lookup @range.value activity=nk7wJnUtROO1cY4W]] feet of itself.</p><p class=\"feature\"><em>Constitution Saving Throw:</em> DC [[lookup @save.dc.value activity=nk7wJnUtROO1cY4W]], each creature in a [[lookup @target.template.size activity=nk7wJnUtROO1cY4W]]-foot-radius [[lookup @target.template.type capitalize activity=nk7wJnUtROO1cY4W]] centered on that point.</p><p class=\"feature\"><em>Failure:</em> [[/damage average]] damage, and the target has the &amp;Reference[Blinded apply=false] condition until the end of the [[lookup @name lowercase]]’s next turn.</p><p class=\"feature\"><span style=\"font-family:'Roboto Condensed', sans-serif\"><em style=\"box-sizing:border-box;user-select:text;scrollbar-width:thin;scrollbar-color:var(--color-scrollbar) var(--color-scrollbar-track);color:rgb(25, 24, 19);font-family:'Roboto Condensed', sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(248, 244, 241);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\">Success:</em></span> Half damage only.</p>",
